DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       nnaammeedd is a Domain Name System (DNS) server, part of the BIND 9 distrib‐
       ution  from  ISC.  For  more  information on the DNS, see _R_F_C _1_0_3_3, _R_F_C
       _1_0_3_4, and _R_F_C _1_0_3_5.

       When invoked without arguments, nnaammeedd reads the  default  configuration
       file ////eettcc//nnaammeedd..ccoonnff, reads any initial data, and listens for queries.

